te_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tPv8w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3e8852f-bc02-4354-9e00-7d1abc4add91","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"w","ts":"1634796188.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6U1y6"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"/home/thinca/.local/bin/vim: error while loading shared libraries: libffi.so.7: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n","ts":"1634796183.027500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a79aeb9f-d3e3-45dd-a42c-abbe4ae2ce6d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h line()","ts":"1634796183.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4S5y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8559f900-90b5-45f2-8133-6c26b6d06270","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"表示領域ってどう取るんや。","ts":"1634796162.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W2W+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ddf3ac0-7353-4419-8c79-7b8a1004a055","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WindowScrolled や WindowResized イベントがほしいと前から思っている (今はない)","ts":"1634796157.026900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1eQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb1aaa48-1483-436e-8847-b6fe3e523b51","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Vim の場合、CursorMoved でやれるというのはありそう。","ts":"1634796091.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Mk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac48232a-c477-41fc-9ce5-bd3bee6d4779","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"画面の表示領域が変わったイベントとか取れるのかな。","ts":"1634796024.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7x1Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3e5e780-4994-4988-8adb-d40d53228115","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"vim-treesitter もそれ入れた方がいいかもしれんな。","ts":"1634795988.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DpFR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17b5045c-1b19-467e-aad6-1ecfdc8ab611","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なるほどね。","ts":"1634795951.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"050Sz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d088c91e-86fc-4ac7-9c4e-7453f34edd24","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく tree-sitter の AST ライクな構造を作るのは全コンテンツ対象で、再ハイライト処理だけが見えてる範囲だけになっているんだと思います。","ts":"1634795917.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+AYo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93e9a770-9d22-47c7-8e70-9e54dcd9651d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それもまぁ、難しいですよね。ファイルの先頭に here doc の記述書いたら後続の行は全部文字列な訳で。","ts":"1634795791.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QNA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd3d7856-2095-4987-99c0-97c8bfd48cb1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"tree-sitter のハイライトなんか向けに作られた仕組みらしいです。（ハイライトも見えてる範囲だけやればいいので）","ts":"1634795525.022000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3DG6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21b86da6-4619-4c86-84d3-1a16dfcb6ef5","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim_set_decoration_provider は「redraw されたウィンドウの redraw された行」の情報をコールバックで手に入れることができ、表示の際の計算量をかなり抑えられる。","ts":"1634795481.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GypXE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71762977-88dd-4ef2-b72f-2b45f0ea1084","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"例えば、LSP の diagnostics なんかを考えると、バッファが 1 万行あり、診断がその全行にあるとしたら、表示するだけでもかなり重くなるのが想像できますが","ts":"1634795439.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wDVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"602ed730-6f76-4a12-9ad8-28e4b675a2be","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"さすがにposの計算とかはズレてくるのかな\nこのあたり完全に「見えるけど内部的にはないもの」として扱えれば便利そう","ts":"1634795421.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fEq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb2fa40c-eb1c-426e-ac5f-34ede568b74f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"オーバーレイは floating window に近い感じで、制約が強い。というのが現状で、あまり使いでがないですね。\nneovim には（個人的に結構キラー機能だと思っているが）nvim_set_decoration_provider という機能があって、virtul_text はこれを使えるのが強いです。","ts":"1634795382.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pTL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b3bdf0b-f980-4a42-a737-cf48af9e976d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"「差し込む」となると、残りのテキストを右にシフトして表示しなきゃいけないし、ハイライトの計算とかいろいろ影響でそう。。。","ts":"1634795314.017500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rFxH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7df96e0-6fe6-4290-bd11-7caa0d585388","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"オーバーレイだと floating window に近い感じになるのかな。スクロールに追従したりスクロールアウトで一緒に隠れたりが違う?","ts":"1634795313.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yIr6d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d84fc941-ac97-4a93-afda-6349fafd5a1f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"特定の行の特定の col に差し込む形で仮想テキストを追加。ができると使いでがいろいろでてくるが。","ts":"1634795280.016100","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1634795290.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TR5Hi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90b4dc7d-850a-4911-a651-6baead154c66","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"diagnosticのhover代わりになればけっこう良さそうかなと個人的に思っているんですが","ts":"1634795276.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8b3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92b427a0-f405-444e-85f8-b884e452e93b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"現状だと、\n• 仮想的な行を挿入して表示\n• 特定の行にオーバーレイする形で、指定した row/col に仮想テキストを追加\n• 特定の行の末尾からはじまる仮想テキストを追加\nここまでかな。","ts":"1634795249.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u7O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39d68999-9b22-4916-9274-d3ffde00bff1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Neovimのghost textってどこまでできるんですかね","ts":"1634795197.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TX6p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f1721a2-4956-45a4-bf6c-c068984ae548","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"悩ましい","ts":"1634795102.013200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pQl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e28081d0-7498-4d73-bf1b-ca7bbef05973","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"色々要望がきてそうでした。（カーソルを仮想行に移動したい！ → それはどっちかというと、実在するバッファを表示上差し込む機能。という立て付けにしたほうがきれいそうだ。）みたいな議論でてましたね。","ts":"1634795059.013000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/wF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80ad1099-e553-4866-aeb4-5b7a5f27c916","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim では仮想的な行を出す機能が実験されている感じですね。","ts":"1634795023.012300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3jt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e304e18-be97-497a-a0eb-c29d6bb85dce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Neovim にはすでにあるって噂を聞いたけどちゃんと調べていない","ts":"1634794903.011900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lbwL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"902fcf3f-2a4e-4e12-975c-ec5fc05f571f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u0026gt; あるいはそもそも「バッファ上に存在しないけど表示だけされる行」を挿入できるようにすると自力で diff の表示ができるのではないだろうかと少し思っています\nこれはいろいろ応用例ありそうだなとは思います。（スニペットが展開されたあとの行をプレビューするとか）","ts":"1634794803.011500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MhL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f9371c0-e46e-4fd0-a559-124d5c34cf43","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"応用例はいくらでもあると思ってます。自分用のメモを埋め込んだり、関数の呼び出し元をインラインで表示したり","ts":"1634794770.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OZW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9f12729-8500-4a05-aecb-ef9e9b377bbd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vimdiff の表示がかなーり強力なので、もう少し融通が効くと便利そうですよね。ただ、結局自分が書いてるような応用しかない気もします。","ts":"1634794680.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HHHlJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34e5153e-8370-4e3f-9030-9a3fd461b5c9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"scrollbind 辺りの制御が死ぬほどつらそう","ts":"1634794624.009100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tkf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48cb455e-49bb-42fb-bf26-a41732c602a1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あるいはそもそも「バッファ上に存在しないけど表示だけされる行」を挿入できるようにすると自力で diff の表示ができるのではないだろうかと少し思っています…(この機能で diff するのは大変そうだけど仕組みは汎用的になって応用が効きそう)","ts":"1634794592.008800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Tuf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"633047f9-8dd2-4eb4-8522-92dbd6b077c3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"このあたりは本体に新しい仕組みがあってもよさそうな気はします","ts":"1634794515.007600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NSR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fec723c0-432a-428b-aca8-f7e126816e7d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"「どのウィンドウと比較するか」というのを指定する手段が一切なくて、全部と比較になるはず","ts":"1634794496.007300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1oIoX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf9755dc-f8aa-4b72-90e0-69fcd3de48e6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あああ、そういうことか。そもそも無理ということか。。。理解しました。","ts":"1634794472.006800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qNN6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"973bf8e0-ddde-48c2-8bee-c809de3aa330","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"同じタブページ内の 'diff' が有効なウィンドウ同士は全部対象になっちゃうはずなので個別は無理かなぁと","ts":"1634794447.006400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"221r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28e16199-8d43-414f-bc80-28730cd6be3b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ナチュラルに実施された diffthis は管理外として無視する方向で。","ts":"1634794413.005700","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1634794423.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a8tKK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c33003f-63b7-4a66-902a-fc34c2df96de","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"プラグインが管理している前提であれば可能。くらいに思っておきます。","ts":"1634794386.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bv0=G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0dde929-6a26-4557-8591-6b98f420f52b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ありがとうございます。了解です。","ts":"1634794373.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nNo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7406589-5d81-493d-bc19-bf6ea987d50b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"同じタブページ内だと組とかじゃなくて全部比較になっちゃいますね","ts":"1634794370.004800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ze"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecc160f5-d10c-4bd2-8aad-3b0f06e4e889","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim 本体に新しい仕組みを入